{{Passive skill box|Pursuit of Faith}}

'''Pursuit of Faith''' is a notable [[Ascendancy passive skill]] for the [[Hierophant]] that grants increased [[totem]] limit and totem duration. It also grants increased totem placement speed.

==Ruthless mode==
{{infocard
|header    = Pursuit of Faith (Ruthless)
|subheader = Ascendancy Notable Passive Skill
|1         = <div class="passive-icon-container passive-icon-type__ascendancy_notable"><div class="passive-icon-frame"></div>[[File:SpiritualEmpowerment (Hierophant) passive skill icon.png]]</div>
|2         = +1 to maximum number of Summoned Totems
}}

Pursuit of Faith in [[Ruthless mode]] does not grant totem duration or placement speed.

